    "body": "Awesome stuff; thank you! I think there's a few opportunities to make this better; let me know what you think. I'm also happy to put in some work directly if you want to move on from this; just let me know.\r\n\r\nI realize some of my comments are about our difference of opinion on what kind of stuff is interesting in the developer edition. As I've said before, I'm happy to defer to your judgment, since you're the one doing the work. So these comments are just for your consideration. My [Twitter poll](https://twitter.com/domenic/status/925456535014203392) seemed to indicate web developers find this stuff useful at least when they understand it, in case that helps.",
